hit COMMIT. Steam Next Fest is on We're part of Steam Next Fest, October 19–26. If you're just finding the game, welcome. The free demo is ready to play. What's in the demo The tutorial and Floors 1–20 of the dungeon. The first two bosses, who ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691418","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:55:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4984370-1846018067945145","game_id":"steam-4984370","kind":"update","title":"Free Demo Update: New Hand, Bounty Page and Ready for Next Fest","summary":"Roll five dice. Hold the good ones and reroll the rest, chasing a poker hand. Your hand dice become minions, any leftover dice become boons, and the army fights on its own. New here? The demo is free. Already played? Here's what's new in 1.0.6. New to play Small Straight: a new hand. Four dice in a row gives your army 1.5x speed. Golden boss chests: sometimes a boss drops a gold-plated chest that always holds a Royal reward. New Floor 16 treasures: Medic's Purse (only when you're hurt), Scholar'","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T19:26:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067945145","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:55:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4984370-1846018067938464","game_id":"steam-4984370","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Roll the Right Dice, Collect a Bounty","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46297847/3c10616714c13dcf29d7b8e53ba638d65a73d332.png Roll five dice. Hold the good ones, reroll the rest, and chase a poker hand. Your dice turn into minions, and the army fights on its own. This update gives every reroll something to sweat over. Bounties From Floor 4, a bounty sign often drops in before a fight, bosses included. It asks for certain dice, like two 4s, and shows the prize up front. Lock in a hand that uses them and collect: Gold, extra damage, a level, a full ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-11T13:15:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067938464","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:55:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4984370-1846018067934263","game_id":"steam-4984370","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Every Leftover Die Now Pays Out","summary":"Roll five dice. Hold the good ones, reroll the rest, and chase a poker hand. Your dice turn into minions, and the army fights on its own. This free demo update shakes things up. Played before? There may be gold waiting for you. No die wasted Missed your poker hand? Those dice don't just sit there anymore. They burst into gold, XP, a heart, extra damage, or an extra minion when you're outnumbered. Even a bad roll pays. {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46297847/a0788f7d22a61f1b43bb78b1835a4c9820c23f6a.png A sha","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T18:01:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067934263","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:55:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4984370-1845383656395948","game_id":"steam-4984370","kind":"announcement","title":"Roll, hold, commit: the Of Dice and Minions demo is out now","summary":"The demo is out now Of Dice and Minions is an auto-battler where you roll dice to build your army. Each of your five dice is a minion type. The higher you roll, the more of that minion spawn. Roll, hold and reroll to land a poker hand: the hand decides which dice deploy and what bonus they get. Then your minions fight on their own. What's in the demo The tutorial, then the first 20 floors of the dungeon, with a boss on Floor 10 and another on Floor 20. The bosses roll dice too. Between fights: j","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T10:32:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656395948","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:55:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4984370-1844751498231488","game_id":"steam-4984370","kind":"announcement","title":"Meet Of Dice and Minions: roll dice, build an army (demo on the way)","summary":"Hi, I'm Rob, the solo developer at Foorbytes. If you just found this page, welcome! Here's the quick version of what Of Dice and Minions is. Roll the dice. Build an army. Every battle starts with five dice. Hold the ones you like and reroll the rest, like Yahtzee. The poker hand you land decides your army: a pair brings a small squad, a full house brings a whole army, and five of a kind brings... you'll see. Then they fight on their own Your minions battle automatically: knights, archers, mages ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-28T13:14:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498231488","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:55:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4984370":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T16:00:01Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T16:00:01Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4984370":"2026-10-26T16:00:01Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4984370":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T16:00:01Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T16:00:01Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T16:00:01Z"},"5332150":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T16:00:01Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T16:00:01Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],